[{"id":4296466607,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABABbgrw","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?u=b7882c94f408976a2f79e8fe6e1ce27fbd48db74&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I think this is a good idea. The approach of starting with a warning and then removing it if there is no sufficient pushback seems like a good midground between compat, and something that's just a loaded footgun for users.\n\nMaybe relevant context: Prior to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116369 builtin singletons were limited to directly inheriting `Object` through a test case. This might have been originally meant to prevent ref counted singletons. The fact that it did not cover user registered singletons might have been a mistake. (Just my interpretation in trying to frame this as a bug though 😅)","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119429#pullrequestreview-4296466607","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119429","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://